---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="更新日志">
  <article class="changelog-page">
    <h1>📋 更新日志</h1>
    <p class="intro">记录网站的每一次成长与完善</p>

    <section class="todo-section">
      <h2>🚀 后续计划</h2>
      <ul class="todo-list">
        <li><span class="icon">📌</span> 增加「球迷等级考试」趣味栏目</li>
        <li><span class="icon">📌</span> 补充各部分内容（欢迎提出宝贵意见&建议：<a href="mailto:kkjusdoit@gmail.com">kkjusdoit@gmail.com</a>）</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="timeline-section">
      <h2>✅ 更新时间线</h2>
      <div class="timeline">
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-date">2026-01-12</div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <h3>英文版本上线 & 投稿栏目</h3>
            <p>1.英文版本上线；2.增加投稿栏目</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-date">2026-01-11</div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <h3>根据樊星们的建议意见（🌹感谢🌹）对内容进行增加、删除、修改、完善</h3>
            <p>1.去除“贵人朋友”栏目；2.去除“自媒体”条目；3.增加“保时捷家书”；4.优化“打爆一切”游戏体验；5.增加“庆祝动作人传人现象”；6.其他细节更正</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <div class="timeline-date">2026-01-10</div>
          <div class="timeline-content">
            <h3>🎉 网站正式上线</h3>
            <p>樊振东互联网档案馆正式发布，包含【职业生涯 语录与梗 贵人与朋友 评价与祝福 媒体链接 天际樊星 孤勇者】这七个页签</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="back-link">
      <a href="/about">← 返回关于页面</a>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .changelog-page {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 0;
  }

  h1 { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }

  .intro {
    color: #666;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .todo-section {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .todo-section h2 {
    color: #c41e3a;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .todo-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .todo-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
    background: #f8f8f8;
    border-radius: 8px;
    border-left: 3px solid #c41e3a;
  }

  .todo-list .icon { font-size: 0.9rem; }

  .timeline-section h2 {
    color: #c41e3a;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .timeline {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 2rem;
  }

  .timeline::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 6px;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #c41e3a, #e8a0a0);
  }

  .timeline-item {
    position: relative;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .timeline-item:last-child { padding-bottom: 0; }

  .timeline-item::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: -2rem;
    top: 0.3rem;
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    background: #c41e3a;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 3px solid #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px #c41e3a;
  }

  .timeline-date {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #c41e3a;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }

  .timeline-content {
    background: #f8f8f8;
    padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
    border-radius: 10px;
    border: 1px solid #eee;
  }

  .timeline-content h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.4rem 0;
    color: #333;
  }

  .timeline-content p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #666;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .back-link {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .back-link a {
    color: #c41e3a;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .back-link a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    .intro { color: #aaa; }
    .todo-list li { background: #2a2a2a; color: #ddd; }
    .timeline-content { background: #2a2a2a; border-color: #444; }
    .timeline-content h3 { color: #eee; }
    .timeline-content p { color: #bbb; }
    .timeline-item::before { border-color: #2a2a2a; }
  }
</style>
